<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέδην</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let loose,
				freely, without restraint,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				342c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1153
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φεύγειν</span> flee
				<i>pell-mell,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πομπείας τῆς ἀ. γεγενημένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βακχεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.172
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ὡς ἔτυχε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					3.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>licentiously, violently,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.20.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without more ado, simply, absolutely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				494e
			</span></i>; <i>straightforwardly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐρωτᾶν</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>Aphr.<i>inSE</i><i><span class="en">
				101.22
			</span></i>.</div>
